B.Qb=s(["Persistent background worker with zero per-request thread spawn latency","Dedicated multi-core OS threads on native; cooperative microtasks on Web & WASM","Automatic RootIsolateToken bridging for background platform channels and plugins","Pre-flight serialization validation and typed IsolateWorkerRemoteException isolation"],t.s)
B.V2=new A.fe("flutter pub add isolate_runner_mixin","import 'package:isolate_runner_mixin/isolate_runner_mixin.dart';","class DataSyncRepository with IsolateRunnerMixin {\n  // 1. One-shot task execution without manual port orchestration\n  Future<List<Item>> parseHeavyJson(String rawJson) => runInWorker(\n    task: (payload) => (jsonDecode(payload) as List)\n        .map((m) => Item.fromJson(m as Map<String, dynamic>))\n        .toList(),\n    message: rawJson,\n  );\n\n  // 2. Persistent background worker with multiplexed request-ID routing\n  Future<void> startWorker() => spawnWorker(onMessage: _dispatchCommand);\n  Future<HashResult> computeHash(String block) =>\n      requestWorker<HashResult>(command: 'hash', payload: block);\n}","Dart executes on a single-threaded UI loop. While Isolate.run() works for one-offs, recurring tasks suffer thread initialization latency and GC pauses when respawned repeatedly. isolate_runner_mixin provides persistent worker lifecycles with multiplexed request routing, automatic RootIsolateToken bridging for background plugins, and robust fault containment on native platforms (Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, Linux), with cooperative event-loop fallback on Web and WASM.",B.Qb,null,null)
B.Qz=s(["RFC 7233 HTTP Range multipart byte requests","Persistent SQLite chunk state machine across app restarts","Automatic retry with exponential backoff and jitter","Built-in SHA-256 and MD5 checksum validation"],t.s)
B.UZ=new A.fe("flutter pub add resumable_downloader","import 'package:resumable_downloader/resumable_downloader.dart';","final downloader = ResumableDownloader(\n  url: 'https://cdn.landxcape.dev/assets/model_weights.bin',\n  savePath: '/local/storage/weights.bin',\n  chunkSizeBytes: 1024 * 1024 * 4, // 4MB chunks\n);\n\ndownloader.progressStream.listen((event) {\n  print('Progress: ${event.percent}% - Speed: ${event.bytesPerSec / 1024} KB/s');\n});\n\nawait downloader.start();","Unstable cellular connections frequently sever long-running binary downloads. Traditional downloaders restart from byte 0, wasting user bandwidth. resumable_downloader parses HTTP Range headers (RFC 7233), persists completed chunk checkpoints to SQLite, and automatically verifies downloaded file integrity via SHA-256 upon assembly.",B.Qz,null,null)
B.OO=s(["High-security Rust core compiled for ARM64 and x86_64","Sub-millisecond RSA and AEAD cryptographic operations","Zero-copy memory pointer sharing via dart:ffi","Protected against timing attacks through constant-time operations"],t.s)
B.UX=new A.fe("flutter pub add ffr_crypto","import 'package:ffr_crypto/ffr_crypto.dart';","// Ultra-fast RSA signature verification powered by Rust\nfinal isValid = FfrCrypto.verifyRsaSignature(\n  publicKeyPem: rsaPublicKeyPem,\n  messageBytes: payloadBytes,\n  signatureBase64: receivedSignature,\n  hashAlgorithm: HashAlgorithm.sha256,\n);\n\n// 99% faster than pure Dart big-integer math implementations","Pure Dart implementations of 2048-bit and 4096-bit RSA modular exponentiation take 150ms to 1,500ms on mobile CPUs, creating unacceptable authentication latency. ffr_crypto compiles high-security Rust cryptographic primitives (ring / openssl) down to native shared libraries, binding directly into Dart via zero-overhead dart:ffi.",B.OO,null,null)
B.PC=s(["Apple Secure Enclave and Android Keystore hardware binding","Biometric authentication gates (Touch ID, Face ID, Fingerprint)","Zero plaintext encryption key exposure in memory","Graceful fallback with strictly-typed failure results"],t.s)
B.UR=new A.fe("flutter pub add biometric_secure_vault","import 'package:biometric_secure_vault/biometric_secure_vault.dart';","final vault = BiometricSecureVault();\n\n// Write sensitive token\nawait vault.write(\n  key: 'jwt_auth_token',\n  value: secureToken,\n  requireBiometric: true,\n);\n\n// Read requires hardware biometric authentication prompt\nfinal result = await vault.read(\n  key: 'jwt_auth_token',\n  promptMessage: 'Authenticate to access banking session',\n);","Financial and healthcare applications cannot store cryptographic secrets in standard SharedPreferences or unprotected disk files. biometric_secure_vault interfaces directly with Apple Secure Enclave (Keychain Services) and Android Keystore (KeyGenParameterSpec with BiometricPrompt), ensuring encryption keys never exist in userland plaintext memory.",B.PC,null,null)
B.QO=s(["Instant feature scaffolding with clean boundary enforcement","Automated test skeleton generation for BLoC and Repositories","Eliminates circular dependency traps in complex Flutter apps","Production-tested architecture conventions"],t.s)
B.UQ=new A.fe("dart pub global activate clean_feature_arch","clean_feature_arch create feature <name>","# 1. Global CLI Scaffolding (Recommended)\n$ clean_feature_arch create feature payment_gateway \\\n    --type=bloc \\\n    --offline-first \\\n    --with-repository-kit\n\n# 2. Local Project Execution via dev_dependencies\n$ dart run clean_feature_arch:create feature order_checkout\n\n# 3. Architectural Lint Rule Boundary Verification\n$ dart run clean_feature_arch:lint --enforce-domain-purity","Scaling enterprise Flutter codebases requires disciplined separation between UI, Business Logic, and Data sources. clean_feature_arch automates the scaffolding of decoupled feature modules, enforcing explicit dependency flow and generating typed unit, repository, and widget test boilerplate out of the box.",B.QO,"clean_feature_arch create feature <name>","dart run clean_feature_arch:create feature <name>")
